# The mastery skill, over 20 levels rather than GMS's 10 so that the book costs
# the 90 the wizard's levels pay out. The mastery runs 12% to 50%, which is the
# same climb every other 20-level mastery makes.
#
# Its other two levers are cut to fit the longer ladder: the crit rate still
# ends at GMS's 5%, and the magic attack is held to a point a level so that it
# does not swamp Meditation's.
name: "Spell Mastery"
skill_order: 7
description:
  "Steadies your casting, so your weakest spells land nearer your best. "
  "Also increases Magic Attack and Critical Rate."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_WIZARD
max_level: 20
base {
  mastery: 0.12
  magic_attack: 1
  crit_rate: 0.0025
}
per_level {
  mastery: 0.02
  magic_attack: 1
  crit_rate: 0.0025
}
